[148.45055, "o", "st high-value analyses:\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[38;2;44;122;57m⏺\u001b[39m\r\u001b[2S\u001b[22;2H \u001b[1mBash\u001b(B\u001b[m(echo '{\"sql\": \"SELECT AVG(oee_score) as avg_oee, MIN(oee_score) as\r\n      min_oee, MAX(oee_score) as max_oee, SUM(CASE WHEN machine_status =\u001b[K\r\n      \\\"Stopped\\\" THEN 5 ELSE 0\u001b[K…\u001b[24;80H\n\u001b[23;33H)\r\n  \u001b[K⎿  \r\u001b[3S\u001b[21;6H\u001b[34mExecuting query (ID: 20250804_162130_7ca6)...\r\n\u001b[39m     \u001b[32mQuery ID: 20250804_162130_7ca6\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n     \u001b[32mStatus: 200\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n     \u001b[K\u001b[2m… +29 lines \u001b[1;25r\u001b[24;18H\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[?2026l\u001b[?2026h\u001b[1;24r\u001b[1;1H\u001b[2S\u001b[22;18H\u001b[2m(ctrl+r to expand)\u001b(B\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[38;2;44;122;57m⏺\u001b[39m\r\u001b[2S\u001b[22;2H \u001b[1mBash\u001b(B\u001b[m(echo '{\"sql\": \"SELECT downtime_reason, COUNT(*) as occurrences,\r\n      SUM(5) as total_minutes FROM mes_data WHERE machine_status =\u001b[K\r\n      \\\"Stopped\\\" AND downtime_reason LIK\u001b[K…\u001b[24;80H\n\u001b[23;43H)\r\n  \u001b[K⎿  \r\u001b[3S\u001b[21;6H\u001b[34mExecuting query (ID: 20250804_162136_23f0)...\r\n\u001b[39m     \u001b[32mQuery ID: 20250804_162136_23f0\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n     \u001b[32mStatus: 200\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n     \u001b[K\u001b[2m…\u001b(B\u001b[m\r\u001b[2S\u001b[22;7"]
[148.450629, "o", "H\u001b[2m +42 lines (ctrl+r to expand)\u001b(B\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m⏺\u001b[39m \u001b[1m🎯\u001b(B\u001b[m\r\u001b[8S\u001b[16;5H\u001b[1m High-Value Analysis Opportunities\u001b(B\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\r\n  Based on the data, here are impactful analyses you could pursue:\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[2m1. \u001b[1m$1.3M Annual Downtime Recovery\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n  - Current: 59,825 minutes downtime in 2 weeks\u001b[K\r\n  - Top culprit: Material jams (13,530 min)\u001b[K\r\n  - Reducing jams by 30% \u001b[K→\r\u001b[6S\u001b[18;27H $390K/year savings\r\n\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[2m2. \u001b[1m$2.6M Scrap Reduction Opportunity\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n  - Current: $601K scrap loss in 2 weeks\u001b[K\r\n  - Annual projection: $15.6M\u001b[K\r\n  - Even 10% improvement \u001b[K→\r\u001b[4S\u001b[20;27H $1.56M/year\r\n\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[2m3. \u001b[1mOEE Deep Dive (46% avg, huge variance)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n  - Find \u001b[K\u001b[1;25r\u001b[24;10H\u001b[?2026l\u001b[?2026h\u001b[1;24r\u001b[1;1H\u001b[24S  \u001b[2m4. \u001b[1mCascade Failure Analysis\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n  - Material starvation (UNP-MAT) likely from upstream issues\u001b[K\r\n  - Map failure propagation patterns\u001b[K\r\n  - Prevent 5,530 minutes of secondary stoppages\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[2m5. \u001b[1mProduct"]
[148.450744, "o", " Profitability Analysis\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n  - Which products have highest margins?\u001b[K\r\n  - Which cause most downtime/changeovers?\u001b[K\r\n  - Optimize production mix for profit\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[2m6. \u001b[1mBottleneck Heat Maps\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n  - Which equipment limits each line?\u001b[K\r\n  - Time-of-day patterns\u001b[K\r\n  - Focus improvement efforts on constraints\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n  Which analysis would deliver the most value for your operation? I can\u001b[K\r\n  dive deep into any of these!\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m>\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;102;102;102mlet's look at scrap recovery\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[38;2;44;122;57m⏺\u001b[39m\u001b[24;80H\n\u001b[23;2H \u001b[1mUpdate Todos\r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m  \u001b[K⎿  \u001b[38;2;87;105;247m\u001b[1m☐\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[24;80H\n\u001b[23;7H\u001b[38;2;87;105;247m\u001b[1m Analyze scrap patterns by equipment type and product\u001b(B\u001b[m          \r\n     \u001b[K\u001b[1;25r\u001b[24;6H\u001b[?2026l☐\u001b[1;24r\u001b[24;80H\n\u001b[23;7H Identify root causes and correlations with operational factors\r\n     \u001b[K☐\u001b[24;80H\n\u001b[23;7H Calculate financial impact by product and equipment\r\n     \u001b[K☐\u001b[24;80H\n\u001b[23;7H Develop targeted "]
